":"Library-managed. Do not specify explicitly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"arrayfieldname","children":[{"type":"text","value":"arrayFieldName"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFieldName"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The array field path."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"indexa","children":[{"type":"text","value":"indexA"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The first index to swap, from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"0"},{"type":"text","value":" through "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"array.length - 1"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"indexb","children":[{"type":"text","value":"indexB"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The second index to swap, from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"0"},{"type":"text","value":" through "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"array.length - 1"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/FieldUpdateOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FieldUpdateOptions"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Controls metadata updates and whether validation runs."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// items: ['first', 'second', 'third']\nformApi.swapFieldValues('items', 0, 2)\n// items: ['third', 'second', 'first']","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tformdata","text":"TFormData","level":3},{"id":"type-parameters-2","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfieldname","text":"TFieldName","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"arrayfieldname","text":"arrayFieldName","level":3},{"id":"indexa","text":"indexA","level":3},{"id":"indexb","text":"indexB","level":3},{"id":"options","text":"options?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype SwapFieldValuesFn<TFormData> = <TFieldName>(arrayFieldName, indexA, indexB, options?) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApiArrayMethods.types.public.ts:97](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApiArrayMethods.types.public.ts#L97)\n\nSwaps two elements in an array field.\n\nPassing equal indices does nothing. Invalid indices or a runtime value that\nis not an array produce a warning and leave the value unchanged.\n\nBy default, the update marks the array field as touched and dirty, notifies\nchange listeners, and runs change validation.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFieldName\n\n`TFieldName` *extends* [`ArrayFieldName`](ArrayFieldName.md)\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### arrayFieldName\n\n`TFieldName`\n\nThe array field path.\n\n### indexA\n\n`number`\n\nThe first index to swap, from `0` through `array.length - 1`.\n\n### indexB\n\n`number`\n\nThe second index to swap, from `0` through `array.length - 1`.\n\n### options?\n\n[`FieldUpdateOptions`](../interfaces/FieldUpdateOptions.md)\n\nControls metadata updates and whether validation runs.\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n// items: ['first', 'second', 'third']\nformApi.swapFieldValues('items', 0, 2)\n// items: ['third', 'second', 'first']\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: SwapFieldValuesFn\ntitle: SwapFieldValuesFn\n---\n\n```ts\ntype SwapFieldValuesFn<TFormData> = <TFieldName>(arrayFieldName, indexA, indexB, options?) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApiArrayMethods.types.public.ts:97](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApiArrayMethods.types.public.ts#L97)\n\nSwaps two elements in an array field.\n\nPassing equal indices does nothing. Invalid indices or a runtime value that\nis not an array produce a warning and leave the value unchanged.\n\nBy default, the update marks the array field as touched and dirty, notifies\nchange listeners, and runs change validation.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFieldName\n\n`TFieldName` *extends* [`ArrayFieldName`](ArrayFieldName.md)\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### arrayFieldName\n\n`TFieldName`\n\nThe array field path.\n\n### indexA\n\n`number`\n\nThe first index to swap, from `0` through `array.length - 1`.\n\n### indexB\n\n`number`\n\nThe second index to swap, from `0` through `array.length - 1`.\n\n### options?\n\n[`FieldUpdateOptions`](../interfaces/FieldUpdateOptions.md)\n\nControls metadata updates and whether validation runs.\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n// items: ['first', 'second', 'third']\nformApi.swapFieldValues('items', 0, 2)\n// items: ['third', 'second', 'first']\n```\n"}
